/-!
# Stage P2 Over-Path Error Arm 6 and Normal-Exit (`+0x1778`) Postcondition

Proves the Error Arm 6 (`get_local_registration_id`, `+0x09f4 → x30`) unwind bridge into
`p2ErrFrameAt`, defines the normal-exit spatial postcondition `p2OverOkPostAt` at `+0x1778`, and
proves the normal-exit framing entailment `p2_over_v1_ok_entails`.
-/

